            "details": "Use static analysis tools like SonarQube or custom scripts to scan the backend/app directory. Focus on identifying common patterns across API routers (companies.py, users.py, projects.py, meetings.py, transcriptions.py, actionItems.py), repository classes, service layers, and exception handling. Create a detailed report documenting: duplicate code blocks over 5 lines, similar function signatures, repeated validation patterns, common error handling routines, and data transformation logic. Prioritize areas with highest duplication for refactoring impact.",
