            "details": "Create backend/app/utils/http/ directory with error_handlers.py and exception_mappers.py. Build upon existing TranskriptException classes in base_exceptions.py to create HTTP exception mappers that convert domain exceptions to appropriate HTTP responses. Extract common error handling patterns from routers (lines 51-60 in companies.py, lines 49-58 in users.py). Implement functions like map_validation_error_to_http(), map_not_found_to_http(), and create_standardized_error_response(). Include logging and monitoring hooks for error tracking.",
            "status": "todo",
            "testStrategy": "Test exception mapping for all defined custom exceptions. Verify HTTP status codes are correctly assigned for different error types. Test error response format consistency across all endpoints. Create integration tests that trigger errors and verify proper handling and response formatting.",
