            "details": "Update all router files (companies.py, users.py, projects.py, meetings.py, transcriptions.py, actionItems.py) to use shared validation, formatting, and error handling utilities. Replace duplicate validation logic with calls to shared validators. Replace duplicate response formatting with shared formatters. Update error handling to use standardized exception mappers. Ensure all changes maintain existing API contracts. Update imports and dependencies. Run comprehensive tests after each module refactoring to ensure functionality is preserved.",
